id: pm-rust-oqst
title: Keep oracle test runs out of Sentry
description: "GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/issues/86: centralize PM_SENTRY_DISABLED=1 and PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=test for every oracle invocation, including CI, just recipes and Rust-spawned drivers; prove the spawned environment with a shim."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[3]: ci,oracle,telemetry
created_at: "2026-10-15T21:43:01.955Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-16T03:24:54.516Z"
author: codex-agent
parent: pm-rust-u4al
comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-15T21:45:14.024Z",codex-agent,"All Rust oracle driver launches, clone-local CI health and merge setup now route through tests/oracle/launch.mts. It applies both test telemetry variables in the final spawned child even after env_clear; a disposable shim asserts the actual child environment, argument boundaries and exit propagation. just recipes also export the same test boundary."
  "2026-10-15T21:51:28.647Z",codex-agent,"Read-only oracle health passes all 8 checks with merge drivers in a clean HOME and neutral global Git configuration, matching CI. The normal host context reports an unrelated global pm-github 2026.10.15 versus locked host 2026.10.14 skew; no pin or shared extension was changed. Existing guidance, stale-item and provenance advisories are retained."
  "2026-10-15T21:58:31.024Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof: removing only PM_SENTRY_DISABLED from the final child environment made cargo test --locked --test oracle_launcher oracle_launcher_sets_child_telemetry_environment -- --exact --nocapture fail with Cargo exit 101 and the shim environment assertion. Independently removing only PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT failed identically. Neither control ran the real oracle. Both mutations were restored; the linked positive launcher test passed 1/1."
  "2026-10-15T22:02:15.706Z",codex-agent,"The final launcher also supports tool descendants: branch-merge Git commands use the shared launcher so the published merge drivers inherit both telemetry variables. The environment shim now checks entry and tool modes with both inherited and cleared parent environments. cargo test --locked --test oracle_launcher --test branch_merge_contract passed 2/2, including the real two-branch merge."
  "2026-10-15T22:21:29.347Z",codex-agent,Final linked launcher receipt passes 1/1 with all four child-environment modes. Both independent telemetry-variable revert controls still fail at the child shim assertion before any real oracle is imported. Starting the full release aggregate with isolated HOME and neutral global Git settings; no thresholds or package pins changed.
  "2026-10-15T23:57:21.664Z",codex-agent,"Complete release-check passed on source head 5e00a16: ordinary 338/338 and instrumented 338/338 across 18 targets each; all four coverage dimensions 100 percent (6412 lines, 611 functions, 9972 regions, 1378 branches). The real child-environment shim checks both telemetry variables across entry/tool and inherited/cleared-environment modes. Both individual variable-removal controls fail with Cargo exit 101 before importing any real oracle. CI, just, all Rust oracle spawns and Git merge-driver descendants share the launcher boundary. Audit and changelog gates pass; pins and thresholds remain unchanged. Releasing ownership without closing."
  "2026-10-16T02:46:48.426Z",codex-agent,"Round 2: scope positional arguments to just oracle and forward through \"$@\". Add a real just-to-launcher echo-shim regression, including a spaced shim path, spaced and empty arguments, literal quotes and a literal shell variable; retain both enforced telemetry values and exit propagation. Install just in the Rust matrix so the regression runs on every OS. Run the behavioural revert, full release aggregate, strict tracker health and final-head platform CI at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-16T02:47:56.320Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof for Round 2: cargo +1.90.0 test --locked --test oracle_launcher just_oracle_preserves_argument_boundaries -- --exact --nocapture passes 1/1 with the final test. Restoring only the original just oracle recipe (removing its positional-arguments attribute and restoring shell interpolation of args) fails with Cargo exit 101: the spaced echo-shim path is split and the child exits 1 instead of the required 7. Restoring the fixed recipe passes 1/1. The unchanged test asserts exact JSON argv including a spaced argument, an empty argument, literal quotes and a literal shell variable, plus PM_SENTRY_DISABLED=1 and PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=test. Linked pm test execution also passes both commands: 2 launcher tests and 20 combined launcher/pipeline tests. Test-result tracking is disabled by existing project policy; this comment records the receipts."
  "2026-10-16T03:24:14.928Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 final local receipt: just release-check passed with isolated HOME and neutral global Git configuration. Ordinary 339/339 and instrumented 339/339 across 18 targets each; zero failures or ignored tests. Unchanged coverage: 6412/6412 lines, 611/611 functions, 9972/9972 regions and 1378/1378 branches, all 100 percent. Formatting, deny-warnings Clippy, private-item rustdoc, identity audit 7/7, cargo audit (134 dependencies; one existing allowed unmaintained advisory), and changelog check passed. Strict locked-oracle health with required merge drivers passed 8/8 checks with three existing advisories. The recipe-only behavioural revert failed with exit 101 and restoration passed 1/1; linked pm test commands passed. This Rust repository has no root package.json; just release-check is its release aggregate. Existing history bytes are unchanged and added tracked content passed a private-path/topology marker check. Releasing ownership without closing; final pushed-head CI will be monitored and reported on PR 87."
  "2026-10-16T03:24:54.515Z",codex-agent,"Post-release tracker health still passes 8/8 required checks with exit 0. This later read additionally reports telemetry_queue_pending:1 alongside the three existing advisories; no telemetry configuration or queue was changed. Claims are released and both items remain unclosed. Changelog regeneration after the receipt writes produced no content change and its check passed."
